{"id":"n53147-3-6","stage":5,"title":"뚝 · 完全地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53147-3-6-1","ko":"만들기 재료가 뚝 떨어져 버렸네.","zh":"做东西的材料突然用完了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"만들기","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만들기","audio":"/audio/81b8d99b4f9bdf3ca857.mp3"}},{"text":"재료가","meaning":"材料","explanation":"재료：材料；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"재료","audio":"/audio/cff206505c96a240e3b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71211","senseId":"1","lemma":"재료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재료가","audio":"/audio/51c98b4721d8facdaeb8.mp3"}},{"text":"뚝","meaning":"完全地，全部地，全都","explanation":"뚝：完全地，全部地，全都","readings":[{"term":"뚝","audio":"/audio/2e408210a6ebe6326657.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53147","senseId":"3","lemma":"뚝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뚝","audio":"/audio/2e408210a6ebe6326657.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어져","meaning":"不足，短缺，耗尽","explanation":"떨어지다：不足，短缺，耗尽；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"19","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어져","audio":"/audio/b25bbda01ba013c51055.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸네.","meaning":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","explanation":"버리다：做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸네","audio":"/audio/a9df2f51a116788ca27d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"cff206505c96a240","term":"재료","zh":"材料","audio":"/audio/cff206505c96a240e3b0.mp3","entryId":"71211","definition":"用于制造物品的东西。","pronunciation":["재료"]},{"id":"2e408210a6ebe632","term":"뚝","zh":"完全地，全部地，全都","audio":"/audio/2e408210a6ebe6326657.mp3","entryId":"53147","definition":"全部用完，一点不剩。","pronunciation":["뚝"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"不足，短缺，耗尽","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"没进行补充，所以现在没有剩余。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dfa2f9b74b57b598872e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n53147-3-6-2","ko":"그래? 그럼 내가 문방구에 가서 사 가지고 올게.","zh":"是吗？那我去文具店买些回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"문방구에","meaning":"文具店","explanation":"문방구：文具店；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"문방구","audio":"/audio/5b663f9ac0a3de24590c.mp3"}]